{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"177","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D1. Encrypting Messages"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Smart Beaver from ABBYY invented a new message encryption method and now wants to check its performance. Checking it manually is long and tiresome, so he decided to ask the ABBYY Cup contestants for help."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A message is a sequence of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":". Encryption uses a key which is a sequence of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1, b2, ..., bm"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"). All numbers from the message and from the key belong to the interval from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", inclusive, and all the calculations are performed modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Encryption is performed in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - m + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" steps. On the first step we add to each number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., am"},{"kind":"text","text":" a corresponding number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1, b2, ..., bm"},{"kind":"text","text":". On the second step we add to each number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a2, a3, ..., am + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" (changed on the previous step) a corresponding number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1, b2, ..., bm"},{"kind":"text","text":". And so on: on step number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" we add to each number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai, ai + 1, ..., ai + m - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" a corresponding number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1, b2, ..., bm"},{"kind":"text","text":". The result of the encryption is the sequence "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":" after "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - m + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" steps."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help the Beaver to write a program that will encrypt messages in the described manner."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first input line contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":", separated by single spaces. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second input line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ ai < c"},{"kind":"text","text":"), separated by single spaces — the original message. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third input line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ bi < c"},{"kind":"text","text":"), separated by single spaces — the encryption key."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input limitations for getting 30 points are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ m ≤ n ≤ 103"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ c ≤ 103"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input limitations for getting 100 points are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ m ≤ n ≤ 105"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ c ≤ 103"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated integers — the result of encrypting the original message."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3 2\n1 1 1 1\n1 1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 1 1 0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 1 5\n1 2 3\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0 1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample the encryption is performed in two steps: after the first step "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a = (0, 0, 0, 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" (remember that the calculations are performed modulo 2), after the second step "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a = (0, 1, 1, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":", and that is the answer. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D1","problemCode":"177D1","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/177/problem/D1"}